1
00:01:01,200 --> 00:01:02,380
Why?

2
00:01:03,800 --> 00:01:05,099
The killer.

3
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:10,020
You're awake. How are you feeling?

4
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:18,880
I'm fine.

5
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,140
I feel much better.

6
00:01:21,580 --> 00:01:23,310
Why was it so serious this time?

7
00:01:25,740 --> 00:01:27,440
Maybe I overused my powers,

8
00:01:28,240 --> 00:01:29,240
and on top of that,

9
00:01:30,020 --> 00:01:31,660
I forced a time reversal.

10
00:01:33,440 --> 00:01:35,600
I'm sorry. It's all because of me.

11
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,180
It's not your fault.

12
00:01:38,780 --> 00:01:40,840
Fortunately, you stopped me in time.

13
00:01:41,280 --> 00:01:41,940
Otherwise,

14
00:01:42,400 --> 00:01:45,000
I would have committed an unforgivable crime.

15
00:01:45,140 --> 00:01:45,840
Crime?

16
00:01:46,580 --> 00:01:48,180
If I kill a living person,

17
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,840
I will turn into an evil spirit

18
00:01:49,840 --> 00:01:51,240
and then be annihilated.

19
00:01:52,880 --> 00:01:54,840
I won't abuse your powers anymore.

20
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:57,009
It's no big deal.

21
00:01:57,800 --> 00:01:59,000
I just need some rest.

22
00:02:00,840 --> 00:02:01,540
Xingcan,

23
00:02:04,680 --> 00:02:06,010
I have one more request.

24
00:02:06,780 --> 00:02:07,580
Tell me.

25
00:02:09,479 --> 00:02:11,840
I don't want you to risk your life

26
00:02:11,980 --> 00:02:13,180
to investigate anymore.

27
00:02:13,180 --> 00:02:14,840
That person is too dangerous.

28
00:02:15,200 --> 00:02:17,260
I don't want you to be in danger again.

29
00:02:20,920 --> 00:02:21,800
I promise you.

30
00:02:24,180 --> 00:02:26,579
There's one more thing I'm thinking about.

31
00:02:27,240 --> 00:02:29,900
If a hard drive could bring down the Ling family,

32
00:02:30,540 --> 00:02:32,740
why didn't your father tell me directly

33
00:02:32,980 --> 00:02:34,000
when he saw me?

34
00:02:36,200 --> 00:02:38,400
You... you mean...

35
00:02:38,740 --> 00:02:39,920
So this matter

36
00:02:40,120 --> 00:02:41,780
is not as simple as it seems.

37
00:02:42,079 --> 00:02:43,960
Can you contact my father now?

38
00:02:48,540 --> 00:02:49,240
No.

39
00:02:51,040 --> 00:02:51,840
True.

40
00:02:52,600 --> 00:02:55,560
My father might have already been reincarnated.

41
00:02:58,640 --> 00:03:02,100
I hope his new life is happy and fulfilling.

42
00:03:08,580 --> 00:03:09,380
This time,

43
00:03:09,880 --> 00:03:11,320
we need to follow the past timeline

44
00:03:11,320 --> 00:03:13,360
and gradually advance the investigation.

45
00:03:13,360 --> 00:03:16,490
We need to gather more witnesses and physical evidence.

46
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:19,000
Okay, I'll follow your lead.

47
00:03:23,079 --> 00:03:25,060
You... you seem

48
00:03:26,440 --> 00:03:27,560
to have changed.

49
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,200
Really?

50
00:03:32,440 --> 00:03:35,000
For the better or for the worse?

51
00:03:36,140 --> 00:03:37,540
Probably for the better.

52
00:03:42,280 --> 00:03:44,680
Why aren't they here yet? It's almost time.

53
00:03:47,280 --> 00:03:48,060
I'm ready.

54
00:03:50,480 --> 00:03:51,540
What are you doing?

55
00:03:52,540 --> 00:03:54,360
I might not be able to hold out this time

56
00:03:54,360 --> 00:03:55,940
for as long as before.

57
00:03:56,579 --> 00:03:58,180
You need to be extra careful.

58
00:03:58,440 --> 00:03:59,180
We agreed.

59
00:03:59,180 --> 00:04:00,600
You can't abuse your power anymore.

60
00:04:00,600 --> 00:04:02,330
Then how are you going to get in?

61
00:04:03,580 --> 00:04:05,480
I'll secretly check the password later

62
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:07,320
and go in when no one is around.

63
00:04:07,440 --> 00:04:09,840
Wouldn't that waste another day for nothing?

64
00:04:09,840 --> 00:04:10,680
I can do it.

65
00:04:11,180 --> 00:04:12,240
Using my power once

66
00:04:12,280 --> 00:04:13,000
won't be a problem.

67
00:04:13,000 --> 00:04:13,800
No.

68
00:04:14,440 --> 00:04:15,920
You're already so weak.

69
00:04:16,480 --> 00:04:17,519
I'm not weak.

70
00:04:22,540 --> 00:04:25,000
It's your fault for wasting an opportunity.

71
00:04:29,180 --> 00:04:30,180
What do we do now?

72
00:04:30,740 --> 00:04:31,800
What else can we do?

73
00:04:32,280 --> 00:04:33,940
Just wait for another chance.

74
00:04:38,060 --> 00:04:38,640
Wait.

75
00:04:38,820 --> 00:04:39,400
Look.

76
00:04:47,180 --> 00:04:49,710
If I had known things would turn out like this,

77
00:04:50,480 --> 00:04:52,810
you wouldn't have had to do that last time.

78
00:04:57,240 --> 00:04:58,970
The equipment is working fine.

79
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,420
Now we just wait for her to show up.

80
00:05:03,580 --> 00:05:06,380
Are you sure you still want to keep looking for her?

81
00:05:07,600 --> 00:05:09,530
She saved you in the last timeline.

82
00:05:09,780 --> 00:05:10,680
Judging from this,

83
00:05:10,680 --> 00:05:12,140
she is not inherently bad.

84
00:05:13,080 --> 00:05:15,140
Although she backstabbed me before.

85
00:05:15,140 --> 00:05:15,980
However,

86
00:05:17,440 --> 00:05:19,300
I want to talk to her one more time.

87
00:05:22,200 --> 00:05:23,000
Mucheng.

88
00:05:24,180 --> 00:05:24,880
Xingcan.

89
00:05:25,480 --> 00:05:26,480
I was just looking for you.

90
00:05:26,480 --> 00:05:27,880
I have something to tell you.

91
00:05:27,880 --> 00:05:29,080
Let's talk in the car.

92
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:35,840
And this is?

93
00:05:36,120 --> 00:05:37,060
He's with me.

94
00:05:39,580 --> 00:05:41,580
Then I'll get straight to the point.

95
00:05:41,880 --> 00:05:43,340
How much money do you want?

96
00:05:43,440 --> 00:05:45,640
I must win this lawsuit.

97
00:05:46,200 --> 00:05:47,730
You can't win this lawsuit.

98
00:05:48,400 --> 00:05:51,340
He has already forged evidence of you blackmailing him.

99
00:05:51,340 --> 00:05:52,270
What did you say?

100
00:05:52,600 --> 00:05:53,420
Work with me.

101
00:05:54,060 --> 00:05:56,390
I guarantee you will regain your freedom.

102
00:05:56,800 --> 00:05:58,200
Why should I believe you?

103
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:08,340
Because of this surveillance footage.

104
00:06:19,440 --> 00:06:20,440
Who are you?

105
00:06:23,580 --> 00:06:26,180
I'm dropping the lawsuit against the company.

106
00:06:28,640 --> 00:06:29,360
I admit

107
00:06:30,300 --> 00:06:32,000
I was immature before,

108
00:06:33,280 --> 00:06:35,840
and shouldn't have caused trouble for the company.

109
00:06:35,840 --> 00:06:36,780
But I know

110
00:06:37,060 --> 00:06:39,260
that everything I have was given by you.

111
00:06:39,840 --> 00:06:41,400
So please be generous,

112
00:06:42,040 --> 00:06:43,370
give me another chance,

113
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,460
and I will definitely behave.

114
00:06:47,280 --> 00:06:48,080
Mucheng.

115
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,400
Thank you.

116
00:06:53,740 --> 00:06:55,000
Hearing what you said,

117
00:06:55,980 --> 00:06:57,110
I am truly relieved.

118
00:06:59,540 --> 00:07:00,340
Mucheng,

119
00:07:00,940 --> 00:07:02,340
on behalf of the company,

120
00:07:02,960 --> 00:07:04,080
I apologize to you.

121
00:07:05,780 --> 00:07:06,580
Mr. Ling,

122
00:07:07,740 --> 00:07:08,760
what do you mean?

123
00:07:20,400 --> 00:07:22,620
I can't hear what they're saying.

124
00:07:30,980 --> 00:07:31,780
Mucheng,

125
00:07:32,600 --> 00:07:34,640
I will return the contract to you as soon as possible,

126
00:07:34,640 --> 00:07:37,440
and have the company allocate a sum of money to you.

127
00:07:37,800 --> 00:07:38,600
Really.

128
00:07:39,800 --> 00:07:40,780
I promised you.

129
00:07:42,780 --> 00:07:43,640
But about this,

130
00:07:44,120 --> 00:07:45,520
you must not tell anyone.

131
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:48,080
I took a big risk for this.

132
00:07:49,780 --> 00:07:50,580
I understand.

133
00:07:51,380 --> 00:07:53,909
The company is full of my father's people now.

134
00:07:55,540 --> 00:07:57,480
So you have to trust me.

135
00:07:58,040 --> 00:07:59,580
Who you met during this time,

136
00:07:59,580 --> 00:08:00,580
and what you said,

137
00:08:01,040 --> 00:08:01,970
you must tell me.

138
00:08:02,820 --> 00:08:03,440
Okay.

139
00:08:05,880 --> 00:08:08,810
Right now, the company is full of my father's people.

140
00:08:08,940 --> 00:08:10,680
So you must believe me.

141
00:08:11,240 --> 00:08:12,800
Who you've met during this time,

142
00:08:12,800 --> 00:08:13,880
what you've said,

143
00:08:14,240 --> 00:08:14,960
you must tell me.

144
00:08:14,960 --> 00:08:17,620
How come this guy seems like a different person?

145
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:19,880
What else did he tell you?

146
00:08:22,040 --> 00:08:24,540
You didn't tell him about us, did you?

147
00:08:25,000 --> 00:08:26,280
Of course I didn't.

148
00:08:29,240 --> 00:08:31,840
But isn't he just confessing without being pressed?

149
00:08:31,840 --> 00:08:33,179
At a time like this,

150
00:08:33,440 --> 00:08:35,840
he pushed everything onto Ling Hengsheng.

151
00:08:38,280 --> 00:08:39,980
Maybe I'm overthinking it.

152
00:08:41,140 --> 00:08:42,799
I thought about it carefully.

153
00:08:43,179 --> 00:08:44,179
For so many years,

154
00:08:44,720 --> 00:08:46,250
he has been quite good to me.

155
00:08:49,580 --> 00:08:50,200
Lawyer Gu,

156
00:08:50,680 --> 00:08:52,080
if there's nothing else,

157
00:08:52,280 --> 00:08:53,140
I'll get going.

158
00:08:54,740 --> 00:08:57,200
Contact us anytime if you have any problems.

159
00:08:57,280 --> 00:08:57,800
Bye.

160
00:08:58,380 --> 00:08:59,040
Bye.

161
00:09:02,580 --> 00:09:04,740
Why do I always feel something is wrong?

162
00:09:04,740 --> 00:09:06,040
More than that.

163
00:09:07,440 --> 00:09:10,400
Ling Ze is suddenly so nice to Mu Cheng.

164
00:09:11,480 --> 00:09:14,040
It makes it hard to guess his next move.

165
00:09:15,580 --> 00:09:18,380
I'm afraid he's hiding evil intentions this time.

166
00:09:22,800 --> 00:09:24,480
You are not from this era.

167
00:09:26,840 --> 00:09:28,700
Why do you ask that all of a sudden?

168
00:09:28,880 --> 00:09:30,400
We've been together for so long.

169
00:09:30,400 --> 00:09:32,020
Your words and actions, every move you make,

170
00:09:32,020 --> 00:09:33,040
are so strange,

171
00:09:33,140 --> 00:09:34,470
like an ancient person.

172
00:09:35,380 --> 00:09:36,180
I...

173
00:09:36,180 --> 00:09:37,140
Tell me.

174
00:09:37,340 --> 00:09:38,840
I won't tell anyone else.

175
00:09:39,600 --> 00:09:40,800
Come on, tell me.

176
00:09:42,940 --> 00:09:46,270
I've just been wandering in this world for a thousand years.

177
00:09:48,200 --> 00:09:49,460
So you are an immortal?

178
00:09:49,840 --> 00:09:50,800
Of course not.

179
00:09:51,580 --> 00:09:52,880
I'm just a lonely soul

180
00:09:52,880 --> 00:09:55,200
who cannot enter the cycle of reincarnation.

181
00:09:55,200 --> 00:09:57,860
Why can't you enter the cycle of reincarnation?

182
00:09:58,440 --> 00:09:59,240
I

183
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:01,970
am waiting for someone.

184
00:10:02,340 --> 00:10:03,140
Who?

185
00:10:09,640 --> 00:10:11,040
It must be a woman, right?

186
00:10:12,480 --> 00:10:13,540
I knew it.

187
00:10:15,880 --> 00:10:16,420
Yes.

188
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,200
I couldn't tell.

189
00:10:18,200 --> 00:10:20,080
You are an affectionate lonely soul.

190
00:10:20,080 --> 00:10:20,880
Is she pretty?

191
00:10:21,400 --> 00:10:22,780
Is she your wife?

192
00:10:23,280 --> 00:10:24,280
Also a ghost?

193
00:10:25,840 --> 00:10:27,370
You have so many questions.

194
00:10:27,940 --> 00:10:28,940
Stingy.

195
00:10:36,240 --> 00:10:37,040
What's wrong?

196
00:10:37,800 --> 00:10:38,380
That guy

197
00:10:38,520 --> 00:10:39,340
asked me out.

198
00:10:42,640 --> 00:10:44,440
Asking to meet at home this late,

199
00:10:44,580 --> 00:10:46,510
he definitely has bad intentions.

200
00:10:47,080 --> 00:10:48,860
It's fine. You're here anyway.

201
00:10:53,980 --> 00:10:55,110
Mr. Gu, you're here.

202
00:10:56,740 --> 00:10:57,780
And this is?

203
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,680
He is my assistant.

204
00:11:00,000 --> 00:11:00,740
He just started today.

205
00:11:00,740 --> 00:11:02,200
It's fine. Please come in.

206
00:11:14,940 --> 00:11:15,520
Mr. Ling,

207
00:11:16,080 --> 00:11:17,380
You called us over so late.

208
00:11:17,380 --> 00:11:18,840
Is there something wrong?

209
00:11:18,980 --> 00:11:19,780
Mr. Gu,

210
00:11:20,680 --> 00:11:23,140
I have something very important to tell you.

211
00:11:23,680 --> 00:11:25,010
What important matter?

212
00:11:28,880 --> 00:11:30,140
Just tell me directly.

213
00:11:30,840 --> 00:11:32,040
Please wait a moment.

214
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:51,240
I know you're that reporter's daughter.
